1. Management & User Tables
TaxDatabase: TaxID (PK), TaxName, TaxPercentage, EffectiveFrom, EffectiveTo

Users: userID (PK), userName, userPhone, userAddress, totalOrders

Staff: staffID (PK), staffName, staffRole, staffPhone, staffSalary, staffStatus

LOGINREST: LoginID (PK), UserName, Password, Role, CreatedAt

2. Menu & Inventory Tables
Categories: catID (PK), catName, catStatus, catImage

Products: prodID (PK), prodName, prodPrice, categoryID (FK), prodStatus, prodImage

Stock: stockID (PK), itemName, category, cartons, qtyPerCarton, totalQty, buyingCost, unitCost, lowStockLevel, expiryDate, entryDate, sellingPrice

3. Operational Tables (Orders & Tables)
RESTTables: tableID (PK), tableName, tableStatus, capacity

Orders: OrderID (PK), OrderNo, OrderType, TableID, WaiterID, OrderStatus, OrderTime

OrderMain: MainID (PK), OrderDate, TableID, WaiterID, OrderType, TotalAmount, Status, UserID

KOT (Kitchen Order Ticket): KOTID (PK), OrderID, KOTTime, Status

4. Order Details & History
OrderDetails: OrderDetailID (PK), OrderID (FK), ProductID (FK), Qty, Price

OrderItems: OrderItemID (PK), OrderID, ProdID, Qty, Price

Payments: PaymentID (PK), OrderID, TotalAmount, Discount, Received, ChangeAmount, PaymentTime

5. Billing History
BillHistory: BillID (PK), OrderID, BillDate, TableID, WaiterID, RiderID, CashierID, OrderType, GrossTotal, TaxAmount, DiscountAmount, NetTotal, ReceivedAmount, ChangeAmount

BillHistoryDetails: BillDetailID (PK), BillID (FK), ProductID, ProductName, Qty, Price, Amount
